Upstream-Name: koserver
Upstream-Contact: NachE <nache.nache@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/SecureCMD/cobiserver
Comment:
 vendor/ holds the Go dependencies this project builds against (`go mod
 vendor`; see vendor/modules.txt for exact versions, matching go.sum).
 `go mod vendor` vendors for every supported OS/architecture, so a few of
 these (currently: github.com/hashicorp/golang-lru/v2,
 github.com/mattn/go-isatty, github.com/ncruces/go-strftime,
 modernc.org/gc/v3, modernc.org/strutil, modernc.org/token) are present
 in vendor/ but do not end up compiled into usr/bin/koserver for any of
 this package's actual build targets (linux/amd64, linux/arm64,
 linux/arm) - confirmed via `go version -m` on the built binary. They're
 still covered below since their source is present in this package.

